      "english": "prevents him from / prevent him from",
      "reason": "Positive HGM ma prevent and byed prevent variants were explicitly considered. Locally the obstacle’s causal instrumental plus negative perception jointly license prevention, while him is supplied. A bare ma/prevents link would assert sole lexical ownership of a distributed causative, and a whole phrase would over-capture him. Leave the contested relation unbanked, never null."
